  "observations": {
    "mirror": "Plain oval with lower foliate ribs, crown lobes, two upturned side scrolls, two curls at foot and a short separate pendant. No readable date or initials in this field.",
    "festoons": "Both heavy carved swags run from the mirror shoulders to circular side bosses. Alternating individual leaves are an approximation of the visible texture; the imagery does not establish a botanical species or exact number.",
    "drops": "The round end bosses, descending ribbons, folded diamonds, shallow small swags, stacked curved scales and terminal tie appear on both sides. Right lower scales visible independently in Gao full resolution (2016).",
    "lettering": "Pale sign below the open upper window reads 歸仁里 from right to left; the green street plate below confirms 3弄3–14号. The dates refer to observations, not installation."
  },
